@startuml
title Modelo de Dominio - Diagrama de Classes

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

class Dataset {
  +key : str
  +label : str
  +theme : str
  +table : int
  +classification_id : int
  +level : str
  +primary_variable : int
  +primary_agg : str
  +narrative : str
}

class Variable {
  +code : int
  +name : str
  +unit : str
  +agg : str
  +weight_by : int
}

class Category {
  +code : int
  +name : str
}

class JobRequest {
  +dataset : str
  +period : str
  +categories : list
  +variables : list
}

class Task {
  +task_id : str
  +job_id : str
  +dataset : str
  +table : int
  +territory_code : str
  +territory_name : str
  +variables : list
  +categories : list
  +period : str
  +attempt : int
}

class Record {
  +territory_code : str
  +territory_name : str
  +variable_code : int
  +variable_name : str
  +unit : str
  +category_code : int
  +category_name : str
  +period : str
  +value : float
  +raw_value : str
}

class TaskResult {
  +task_id : str
  +job_id : str
  +worker_id : str
  +duration_ms : int
  +attempt : int
  +records : list
  +error : str
}

class JobStatus {
  +job_id : str
  +status : str
  +total_tasks : int
  +done_tasks : int
  +failed_tasks : int
  +workers_involved : list
}

class SidraClient {
  +fetch(...) : list
  +last_period(...) : str
}

class Store {
  +create_job(...)
  +complete_task(...)
  +finish_job(...)
  +records_of_job(...)
}

class Worker {
  +worker_id : str
  +tasks_done : int
  +handle(task) : TaskResult
  +run() : void
}

Dataset "1" o-- "n" Variable
Dataset "1" o-- "n" Category
JobRequest ..> Dataset : escolhe
JobRequest ..> Dispatcher : gera
Dispatcher ..> Task : cria 1 por UF
Task "1" --> "1" Dataset : consulta
Task ..> SidraClient : busca
Task ..> Worker : executa
Worker ..> TaskResult : devolve
TaskResult "1" *-- "n" Record
TaskResult ..> Store : persiste
Store ..> JobStatus : status
Store ..> Reduce : agrega
Reduce ..> Dataset : metricas

@enduml
